  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart Grid Study, through CH2M HILL, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project planning advisory services activity is to support the Ethiopian Electrical Utility&apos;s plan to integrate smart grid technologies into its electricity distribution system. The implementation of smart grid technologies would increase the reliability of Ethiopia&apos;s distribution network and provide opportunities for U.S. companies to participate in the sector. The technical assistance will be carried out under USTDA&apos;s Energy Indefinite Delivery Indefinite Quantity Contract.</narrative>
  </description>
